UPDATE companies SET description='Aero Tech Manufacturing, Inc. was founded in 1967 in North Salt Lake, Utah. The company operates as an employee-owned business, a structure that the leadership says aligns accountability with day-to-day production decisions. It began as a precision sheet metal fabrication shop and has since expanded into multiple product lines.

Today the 84,000-square-foot facility houses custom sheet metal fabrication, powder coating and finishing, UL 508-listed industrial control panel assembly, electrical and pneumatic system integration, and electromechanical assembly. The shop supports both prototyping and full production runs, delivering components for truck mounts, radiant ceiling panels, and a range of industrial sub-assemblies.

The company serves customers in cleaning and restoration, aerospace and defense, medical and laboratory, industrial manufacturing, water and filtration systems, and material handling and automation. Professional cleaning contractors rely on its truck mount systems, while OEMs in aerospace and medical device sectors source precision sheet metal components and value-added assemblies.

Aero Tech emphasizes in-house control, with engineering, fabrication, and assembly under one roof to manage quality, timelines, and outcomes. The firm highlights its ISO 9001 certification, a five-stage cleaning and phosphate pretreatment system for coatings, and real-time project tracking as factors that differentiate its service.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom sheet metal fabrication", "Powder coating and finishing", "UL 508 industrial control panel assembly", "Electrical and pneumatic system integration", "Electromechanical assembly", "Prototyping", "Production runs", "Radiant ceiling panel manufacturing", "Truck mount manufacturing"], "industries": ["Cleaning & Restoration", "Aerospace & Defense", "Medical & Laboratory", "Industrial & Manufacturing", "Water & Filtration Systems", "Material Handling & Automation"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["5-stage cleaning/phosphate system", "CAD/NC programming systems"], "volume": "Prototype to production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Engineering, fabrication, and assembly under one roof for total control over quality, timelines, and outcomes", "Designed to perform in the field, not just on paper", "ISO 9001 certified with consistent quality from prototype to production", "Employee-owned structure driving pride and accountability", "84,000 sq ft modern facility with five-stage cleaning/phosphate system"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1967 -> db", "Headquarters North Salt Lake, Utah -> db", "Employee-owned -> db and /", "84,000 sq ft facility -> /about-us", "Industries served: Cleaning & Restoration, Aerospace & Defense, Medical & Laboratory, Industrial & Manufacturing, Water & Filtration Systems, Material Handling & Automation -> /", "Capabilities: custom sheet metal fabrication, powder coating, UL 508 panels, electrical/pneumatic assembly, electromechanical assembly, prototyping, production runs -> /", "Products: truck mounts, radiant ceiling panels -> /", "