UPDATE companies SET description='Ayanna Plastics & Engineering, Inc. was founded in 2001 in Clearwater, Florida.

The company operates a turnkey manufacturing platform that covers part design, material selection, mold design, mold building, mold transfer management, and injection molding production. Its team employs scientific molding disciplines to maintain process control and consistency across runs. Annual output reaches approximately 10 million molded parts, supported by a workforce with an average tenure of eight years.

Ayanna serves customers in the medical, industrial, consumer, aerospace, marine, and defense sectors. The firm works with engineered resins and manages projects from initial concept through finished components, including mold builds that typically require four to twelve weeks depending on complexity.

Leadership emphasizes a solutions-driven approach, positioning the company as a partner that guides clients from idea to production. Quality management is based on ISO 9001 and ISO 13485 standards, and the facility is UL registered. The company has been recognized as a "World''s Greatest" plastic injection molding company and a two-time Plastics News Best Places to Work honoree.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 13485','UL Registered']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Scientific Molding", "Mold Design", "Mold Building", "Mold Transfer Management", "Project Management", "Part Design", "Material Selection", "Injection Molding", "Process Controls", "Capability Studies"], "industries": ["Medical", "Industrial", "Consumer", "Aerospace", "Marine", "Defense"], "materials": ["Engineered resins"], "equipment": [], "volume": "10 million parts yearly", "lead_time": "4-12 weeks for mold building", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Scientific molding for complete process control", "Turnkey manufacturing platform from design to finished product", "ISO 9001 and ISO 13485 certified with UL registration", "Mold building in 4-12 weeks", "8-year average employee tenure"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2001 -> page /", "Headquarters in Clearwater, Florida -> page /", "ISO 9001 and ISO 13485 certified, UL registered -> page /, db", "10 million parts molded yearly -> page /", "280 clients -> page /", "8 years average employee tenure -> page /", "Industries served: medical, industrial, consumer, aerospace, marine, defense -> db description", "Capabilities: scientific molding, mold design, mold building, mold transfer management, project management, part design, material selection -> page /", "Mold building lead time 4-12 weeks -> page /", "Turnkey manufacturing platform from design through finished products -> page /", "World''s Greatest plastic injection molding company award -> page /", "Two-time Plastics News Best Places to Work -> page /"], "company_type": null, "makes_products": 