UPDATE companies SET description='Best Manufacturing Inc. operates from Jonesboro, Arkansas, where it was founded in 1990. The company is a subsidiary of Reliance, Inc., and has served as a provider of component parts since its establishment.

The company specializes in sheet metal fabrication, offering high-speed production laser cutting, CNC machining, welding, CNC punching, plate rolling, robotic CNC forming, and powder coat painting. A fully-stocked warehouse carries carbon steel, galvanized steel, aluminum, and stainless steel, supported by inventory management to enable quick turnaround. Capabilities extend from initial design and prototyping through to completely welded assemblies.

Best Manufacturing serves a broad range of industries, including agriculture, construction, data centers, electrical enclosures, energy equipment, environmental, industrial, lawn and garden, marine, material handling, POS display and kiosks, power grid, railcar, solar, transportation, and truck and trailer manufacturing.

The company emphasizes its integrated approach, combining cutting-edge fabrication technology with engineering expertise, and highlights its warehouse inventory and automated equipment as key to meeting dynamic market demands with swift turnarounds. It also stresses reliable partnerships with clients and suppliers.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Laser cutting (high-speed production)", "CNC machining", "Welding", "CNC punching", "Plate rolling", "Robotic CNC forming", "Powder coat painting", "Sheet metal fabrication", "Prototyping", "Design assistance", "Inventory management"], "industries": ["Agriculture", "Construction", "Data Center", "Electrical Enclosures", "Energy Equipment", "Environmental", "Industrial", "Lawn & Garden", "Marine", "Material Handling", "POS Display/Kiosks", "Power Grid", "Railcar", "Solar", "Transportation", "Truck/Trailer"], "materials": ["Carbon steel", "Galvanized steel", "Aluminum", "Stainless steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fully-stocked warehouse with carbon steel, galvanized, aluminum, and stainless steel for quick turnaround", "High-speed production laser cutting", "Robotic CNC forming", "Comprehensive in-house capabilities including welding, CNC punching, machining, plate rolling, and powder coat painting", "ISO 9001 certified quality management"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1990 -> db", "Headquarters Jonesboro, Arkansas -> db", "Subsidiary of Reliance, Inc. -> /about-us", "Services: laser cutting, welding, CNC punching, machining, plate rolling, robotic CNC forming, powder coat painting -> /", "Materials: carbon steel, galvanized steel, aluminum, stainless steel -> description, /about-us", "Industries served list -> /", "Certification ISO 9001 -> db", "Fully-stocked warehouse with inventory management for quick turnaround -> description, /about-us", "High-speed production laser cutting -> /", "Robotic CNC forming -> /", "One-stop sheet m