UPDATE companies SET description='Blue Ridge Industries was founded in 1985 in Winchester, Virginia, as a small custom injection molder. The company has grown from its origins into a full-service contract manufacturer operating around the clock from its Virginia facility.

Today Blue Ridge runs 25 injection molding presses ranging from 50 to 1,000 tons, supporting over 100 active molds and 24/7 production. The roughly 95-person team provides engineering support, 3D printing and rapid prototyping, automated assembly, plastics decorating (hot stamping and pad printing), ultrasonic welding, and fulfillment and warehousing services. The facility leverages 6-axis robotics, ERP-integrated statistical process control, and inspection equipment including CMM, optical gaging, and image measurement machines.

The company serves automotive, medical, and consumer goods markets, among others, and counts Trex Company, Schonstedt Instrument Company, Spire LLC, and Palram Americas among its customers. Its quality system is ISO 9001:2015 certified and IATF16949 MAQMSR compliant, with reported in-process acceptance rates at or above 98 percent and on-time delivery at or above 98 percent.

Blue Ridge emphasizes an ingenuity-driven mindset that combines data-informed design, lean manufacturing, and a family-like culture. Its mission centers on creating quality solutions through dedicated partnerships, integrity, efficiency, and teamwork, with leadership highlighting continuous improvement and proactive problem-solving as core differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','IATF16949 MAQMSR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom Injection Molding (50\u20131,000 ton presses)", "Engineering Support (Design for Manufacturability, Mold Flow Analysis, Material Selection)", "3D Printing and Rapid Prototyping", "Automated Manufacturing (6-axis Robotics)", "Contract Manufacturing and Assembly", "Ultrasonic Welding", "Insert Installation", "Component Assembly", "Functional Testing", "Retail-ready Packaging", "Plastics Decorating (Hot Stamping, Pad Printing)", "Fulfillment and Warehousing (Min/Max Inventory Management, Pick-and-Pack)", "Just-in-Time Delivery", "Statistical Process Control (SPC) with Real-time Data Monitoring", "Coordinate Measuring Machine (CMM) Inspection", "Optical Gaging Inspection", "Image Measurement Machine (IMM) Inspection", "Low-volume to High-volume Production"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Medical", "Consumer Goods"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["25 Injection Molding Presses (50\u20131,000 tons)", "6-axis Robotic Automation", "Optical Gaging System", "Image Measurement Machine (IMM)", "Coordinate Measuring Machine (CMM)", "3D Printers (for prototyping)", "ERP-integrated SPC Software"], "volume": "Low-volume to high-volume production", "lead_time": "Rapid prototyping in days; 24-hour shipping for fulfillment orders", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7 operations with 25 presses (50\u20131,000 tons) and 100+ active molds", "ISO 9001:2015 certification and IATF16949 MAQMSR compliance", "In-house engineering, 3D printing, assembly, decorating, and fulfillment under one roof", "ERP-integrated Statistical Process Contro