UPDATE companies SET description='Business Furniture + Co. is headquartered in Indianapolis, Indiana, with additional locations in Dayton, Ohio, and Noblesville and Fishers, Indiana. The company was founded in 1922 and has operated continuously for over a century. In 1987, Dick Oakes purchased the business from John Ober after a 20-year career as a sales executive at Steelcase. Today it is a certified woman-owned enterprise led by CEO and co-owner Mary Beth Oakes and President and co-owner Suzanne Bentley.

The firm provides end-to-end workplace solutions, including space planning, furniture procurement, installation, project management, and workplace strategy. Through its Choreo division, it delivers change-management services that guide organizations through cultural and spatial transformations. As an authorized Steelcase partner, it leverages research-driven product lines to outfit corporate offices, healthcare facilities, K-12 and higher-education campuses, and senior-living communities. The team includes specialists in design, operations, business development, safety, and quality, operating across multiple showrooms and a distribution center.

Clients span corporate, healthcare, education, and senior-living sectors. Concrete examples include St. Mary''s Children Center (referenced in leadership bios), K-12 school districts served by a dedicated business-development team, and higher-education institutions. The company also supports workplace strategy engagements for organizations undergoing mergers, relocations, or cultural shifts.

The company''s stated differentiator is its belief that "space shapes behavior, behaviors create culture, and culture drives results." This philosophy, combined with a century of institutional knowledge and a human-centered design approach, is presented as the foundation for creating environments where collaboration and innovation occur naturally.', certifications=ARRAY['WOMAN-OWNED']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Workplace design and space planning", "Furniture procurement and specification", "Installation and reconfiguration services", "Project management and coordination", "Workplace strategy consulting", "Change management (Choreo division)", "Healthcare environment design", "K-12 educational space design", "Higher education campus furnishings", "Senior living community design", "Corporate office fit-out", "Workplace research and analytics", "Safety and quality program management", "Virtual tour and remote consultation", "Showroom-based product evaluation"], "industries": ["Corporate offices", "Healthcare", "K-12 education", "Higher education", "Senior living"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded 1922 -> /about (our story) and db", "Headquarters Indianapolis, Indiana -> db and / (contact info)", "Additional locations Dayton OH, Noblesville IN, Fishers IN -> / (addresses) and /about (MINDSET Fishers mention)", "Dick Oakes purchased from John Ober in 1987 -> /about (Dick Oakes quote)", "Woman-owned, led by Mary Beth Oakes (CEO) and Suzanne Bentley (President) -> /about and db certifications", "Steelcase partner -> /about (Partnered with Steelcase)", "Choreo change management division -> /about and / (Choreo: Change Mgmt)", "Industries: corporate, healthcare, K12, higher ed, senior living -> / and /about (navigation and text)", "Leadership team names and roles -> /about (Our Leadership Team section)", "Philosophy: space shapes behavior -> /about (At our core...)", "St. Ma