UPDATE companies SET description='Cable Depot, Inc. was founded in 1990 in Norcross, Georgia, on principles of hard work, honesty, integrity, dedication, and strong relationships. The company describes its ethos as "The Spirit of Service," aiming to earn and retain customer trust.

The company manufactures custom and standard cable and fiber optic assemblies, including telco cables, custom molded cables, RF cables, SAS/SATA cables, IDC ribbon cables, and electromechanical assemblies. It offers custom cable design, prototyping, and manufacturing, with over 3,500 standard cable and interconnect products stocked. Production covers copper and fiber optic cable assemblies, harnesses, adapters, and connectivity products, supported by advanced equipment and a zero-defect quality program.

Cable Depot serves the medical, electronics, automotive, telecom, military (Mil Spec), robotics, instrumentation, audio, marine, and industrial markets. Its customers include OEMs, resellers, and engineering firms that rely on the company for data, voice, and video connectivity solutions.

The company emphasizes a rigorous zero-defects QA program, 100% product testing and guarantee, advanced equipment and tooling, engineering and prototyping support, on-time delivery, and competitive pricing as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['ROHS','MIL SPEC']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom fiber optic cable assembly", "Custom RF cable assembly", "Custom IDC ribbon cable assembly", "Custom electromechanical assembly", "Custom molded cable manufacturing", "Cable harness assembly", "Custom cable design and engineering", "Prototyping", "100% product testing", "Zero-defect quality assurance", "Specialty fiber coatings", "SAS & SATA cable assembly", "Telco cable assembly", "Copper cable assembly", "Fiber optic cable assembly (multimode/singlemode)", "Pre-terminated fiber assemblies", "Component selection and interconnection layout design"], "industries": ["Medical", "Electronics", "Automotive", "Telecom", "Military (Mil Spec)", "Robotics", "Instrumentation", "Audio", "Marine", "Industrial"], "materials": ["Copper", "Multimode Fiber", "Singlemode Fiber"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Rigorous zero-defects QA program", "100% product testing and guarantee", "Advanced equipment and tooling", "Engineering and prototyping support", "On-time delivery"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1990 -> db", "Headquarters in Norcross, Georgia -> db", "Certifications: ROHS, MIL SPEC -> db", "Capabilities list -> db", "Company founded on principles of hard work, honesty, integrity, dedication, strong relationships -> /", "Spirit of Service ethos -> /", "Over 3,500 standard cable and interconnect products in stock -> /", "Industries served: Medical, Electronics, Automotive, Telecom, Mil Spec, Military, Robotics, Instrumentation, Audio, Marine, Industrial -> /", "Customer types: OEMs, resellers, engineering companies -> /", "Diversified production of copper & fiber optic cable assemblies, harnesses, adapters, connectivity p