UPDATE companies SET description='Commercial Creamery Company has operated from Jerome, Idaho, since its founding in 1908. The business remains family-owned, now in its fourth generation, and runs its primary manufacturing plant in the Magic Valley region of southern Idaho, where a concentration of dairies provides a steady local supply of milk, cream, and cheese.

The company produces cheese powders, specialty dairy powders, and seasonings, offering custom blending and specialty flavor development. Its technical team supports product development through culinary arts, dairy and flavor chemistry, sensory evaluation, and nutrition analysis. Quality control and assurance programs cover organoleptic, physical, chemical, and microbiological testing across conventional, organic, kosher, halal, gluten-free, and Non-GMO Project Verifiable product lines. The facility serves thousands of clients across the United States and exports to more than 30 countries.

Customers span snack foods, soups and sauces, dressings and dips, pet foods, beverages, baking, nutraceuticals, entrees, and broader flavor applications. The company positions itself as a partner from concept to finished product, emphasizing flexibility in order quantities and rapid response to client needs.

The operation is SQF certified, FSMA compliant, and operates under HACCP-based risk assessment.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF','FSMA compliant','HACCP','Organic','Kosher','Halal','Non-GMO Project Verifiable','Gluten Free']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cheese powder manufacturing", "Specialty dairy powder manufacturing", "Seasoning manufacturing", "Custom blending", "Specialty flavor development", "Culinary arts", "Dairy and flavor chemistry", "Sensory evaluation", "Nutrition analysis", "Food safety and quality programs", "Quality control and quality assurance", "Organic production", "Kosher production", "Halal production", "Non-GMO Project Verifiable production", "Gluten-free production", "Conventional production"], "industries": ["Snack foods", "Soups and sauces", "Dressings and dips", "Pet foods", "Beverages", "Baking", "Nutraceuticals", "Entrees", "Flavor applications"], "materials": ["Milk", "Cream", "Cheese"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned for four generations with consistent quality standards", "Flexible order quantities tailored to customer needs", "SQF certified, FSMA compliant, HACCP-based food safety system", "Local fresh dairy supply from Idaho''s Magic Valley", "Custom blending and specialty flavor development with in-house technical expertise"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1908 -> db, /", "Headquarters Jerome, Idaho -> db, /", "Family-owned four generations -> /", "Manufactures cheese powders, specialty dairy powders, seasonings -> /", "Exports to 30+ countries -> /", "Applications: snack foods, soups and sauces, dressings and dips, pet foods, beverages, baking, nutraceuticals, entrees, flavor applications -> /", "SQF certified -> db, /services", "FSMA compliant -> /services", "HACCP-based risk assessment -> /services", "Organic, Kosher, Halal, Non-GMO Project Verifiable, Gluten Free options -> /services", "Custom blending and specialty flavors -> /", "Technical product development: culina